{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001855747","cik":"0001855747","slug":"blend-labs-855747","name":"Blend Labs, Inc.","ticker":"BLND","exchanges":["NYSE"],"sector":"Services-Computer Programming, Data Processing, Etc.","sic":"7370","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":4.3,"first_annual":"2022-03-31","last_filing":"2026-06-23","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001855747&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Blend Labs, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Computer Programming, Data Processing, Etc.\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $122.0m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 14.9% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 75.8%.","Listed on NYSE, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 31 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 14.9% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $30.8m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"Gross margin of 75.8% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 70.8% to 75.8% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"Net cash of $59.0m against total assets of $161.3m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-1.2% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"}],"bear":[{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-16.4% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"About 31 months of cash at the current burn ($59.0m against $23.1m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$55.9m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000185574726000042/0001855747-26-000042-index.htm","accession":"0001855747-26-000042"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.3% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1855747/000165593326000004/0001655933-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 68.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below"